WEBVTT

01:41.680 --> 01:48.910
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.250 --> 01:51.870
[Episode 18]

01:55.210 --> 01:58.700
[Five years later]

01:59.340 --> 02:02.910
[2018]

02:10.620 --> 02:11.020
Hello.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.930
Please check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.

02:12.930 --> 02:14.060
Explore green,
low-carbon mode of transportation.

02:14.060 --> 02:15.500
Just scan this code.

02:15.500 --> 02:17.180
Hello.
Please check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.

02:17.180 --> 02:18.410
Explore green,
low-carbon mode of transportation.

02:18.410 --> 02:21.370
-Check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.
-Duan Qiyan has transformed

02:21.370 --> 02:23.840
from Duan to Mr. Duan.

02:25.210 --> 02:26.210
In college,

02:26.460 --> 02:27.690
he kept sending us

02:27.690 --> 02:30.900
the video clip of him
winning the championship

02:30.900 --> 02:33.520
in the college venture competition with a huge lead.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.470
In the video,

02:34.579 --> 02:37.130
Duan Qiyan talks confidently
about the bike-sharing project

02:37.130 --> 02:39.300
called Qilewuqiong,

02:40.400 --> 02:42.120
describing the blueprint for solving

02:42.120 --> 02:44.560
the city's last-mile travel problem.

02:46.900 --> 02:48.500
Check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.

02:48.500 --> 02:50.960
You say this promoter
doesn't look like him?

02:54.120 --> 02:55.840
Because that's not him.

02:56.530 --> 02:57.860
He's the one next to him.

03:02.090 --> 03:04.500
Mr. Duan, they won't take the flyers.

03:05.090 --> 03:06.500
How many times have I told you?

03:06.500 --> 03:08.020
I'm not Mr. Duan right now.

03:08.090 --> 03:09.250
I'm Qiqi—

03:09.690 --> 03:11.970
Qiqi from Qilewuqiong.

03:12.460 --> 03:13.320
Hey, Handsome.

03:13.710 --> 03:16.000
I can tell you're a sporty boy
at a glance.

03:16.230 --> 03:18.290
Do you usually like riding bicycles?

03:18.680 --> 03:20.810
Look at these bikes, aren't they cool?

03:21.030 --> 03:21.870
If you think so,

03:21.870 --> 03:24.360
hurry up and ask your parents
to scan the code for you.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.960
I will give you a little gift.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.710
Baby, what's going on?

03:31.310 --> 03:32.520
Mom, scan the code.

03:37.300 --> 03:39.500
You must still remember Tang Tingting.

03:40.400 --> 03:42.560
Back then, she was almost scammed
while chasing her idol.

03:42.470 --> 03:45.230
[Star Shine Media]

03:42.780 --> 03:44.060
A few of us friends

03:44.060 --> 03:45.650
helped her get back at them.

03:45.340 --> 03:48.700
[Star Shine Media reading shelf]

03:46.520 --> 03:49.840
Although Duan Qiyan always mocked her
for being bad at studying,

03:49.840 --> 03:51.370
think about it—
how bad can the worst student

03:51.370 --> 03:53.870
in the province's best high school's
experimental class

03:53.870 --> 03:55.130
really be?

04:09.620 --> 04:13.930
[Star Shine Media]

04:09.840 --> 04:11.030
She was admitted to Zhendan University

04:11.030 --> 04:12.150
to study media.

04:12.900 --> 04:15.150
Upon graduation,
she decided to put into practice

04:15.150 --> 04:17.810
what it would be like
to turn her hobby into a job.

04:18.040 --> 04:18.769
Sure enough,

04:19.680 --> 04:20.690
it's not great.

04:28.240 --> 04:30.970
Mr. Wang,
I'll take up 5 more minutes of your time.

04:31.160 --> 04:33.750
Our Su Mo is really good.

04:33.750 --> 04:35.480
Whether it's singing, dancing, or sports—

04:35.480 --> 04:37.360
he is proficient in all kinds of talents.

04:37.360 --> 04:39.070
And he can endure a lot of hardship.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.040
During his filming last time,

04:40.040 --> 04:42.100
his leg was fractured from wire work.

04:42.190 --> 04:45.240
He continued to film
the dialogue scenes with a cast on.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.720
All our upcoming roles

04:46.870 --> 04:48.400
require a more mature look.

04:48.680 --> 04:49.830
Your Su...

04:49.950 --> 04:51.010
That's no problem.

04:51.360 --> 04:53.630
Aren't actors
supposed to shape their roles?

04:53.630 --> 04:55.680
How can every role be custom-made?

04:57.120 --> 04:59.120
I think as long as he understands
the character well,

04:59.120 --> 05:00.800
and with the makeup and styling,

05:00.800 --> 05:02.830
looking 5 to 6 years older
is definitely not a problem.

05:02.830 --> 05:04.800
He is indeed not bad.

05:05.310 --> 05:06.630
But for the upcoming roles,

05:06.630 --> 05:08.690
Mr. Zheng has almost finalized them.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.040
Let's work together

05:10.040 --> 05:11.840
next time when there's a chance.

05:12.800 --> 05:13.510
I...

05:17.480 --> 05:18.210
Director Li?

05:18.680 --> 05:20.120
You've reached the second basement level?

05:20.120 --> 05:21.430
Okay, I'll come pick you up right away.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.160
All right.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.190
Mr. Wang...

05:23.190 --> 05:24.430
Tang, please stay.

05:24.430 --> 05:25.560
No need to see me off.

05:31.950 --> 05:32.680
Our next step

05:32.680 --> 05:34.390
is to optimize our system architecture.

05:34.390 --> 05:35.310
We will use Java's

05:35.310 --> 05:35.980
Spring Boot

05:35.980 --> 05:37.510
framework to restructure the backend

05:37.510 --> 05:39.159
to ensure an increase in operational
and maintenance efficiency.

05:39.159 --> 05:41.390
We have also independently developed
an intelligent monitoring system

05:41.390 --> 05:43.630
to better monitor
the status of our vehicles.

05:43.630 --> 05:45.690
Mr. Liu, won't you take another look?

05:46.480 --> 05:47.270
Mr. Liu!

06:06.480 --> 06:07.480
Well...

06:07.870 --> 06:09.270
That was an investor just now.

06:09.270 --> 06:09.950
He

06:10.160 --> 06:11.800
insisted on investing in our project.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.870
But to be honest,

06:13.000 --> 06:14.800
we don't usually consider

06:14.800 --> 06:16.560
small fund firms like them.

06:19.120 --> 06:19.870
What's up?

06:20.270 --> 06:21.560
Agent Tang,

06:21.680 --> 06:23.940
you're here talking business today too?

06:24.070 --> 06:24.800
Yes.

06:25.190 --> 06:27.360
Our Su Mo is very popular now.

06:27.360 --> 06:29.760
Several big projects are fighting for him.

06:30.000 --> 06:32.750
I'm here to reject Mr. Wang.

06:33.159 --> 06:35.159
I can't even schedule all his projects.

06:35.159 --> 06:37.220
I'm just afraid of offending people.

06:37.870 --> 06:39.130
I'm going to be honest—

06:39.310 --> 06:41.440
this Su Mo isn't even as handsome as me.

06:41.830 --> 06:42.630
With so many big stars

06:42.630 --> 06:44.000
in your company,

06:44.000 --> 06:45.530
why insist on managing him?

06:45.560 --> 06:46.720
What do you know?

06:47.040 --> 06:49.480
Our Su Mo is a future top star.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.600
Mind your own business.

06:51.630 --> 06:53.360
I tried your shared bike last time,

06:53.360 --> 06:54.630
it felt like riding a spin bike.

06:54.630 --> 06:55.830
It was so exhausting.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.260
Do something about it.

06:59.390 --> 07:00.430
Okay, I got it.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.070
Then...

07:07.190 --> 07:09.040
Good... bye?

07:11.600 --> 07:12.480
Bye-bye.

07:14.560 --> 07:15.420
All right then.

07:15.510 --> 07:16.160
Well,

07:16.870 --> 07:17.630
bye-bye.

07:18.800 --> 07:19.430
Bye.

07:33.820 --> 07:36.760
[Lin Zhixia]

07:39.070 --> 07:41.270
Shen Fuxuan went to study abroad alone.

07:42.159 --> 07:43.360
Many mornings,

07:44.040 --> 07:46.300
I would see Shen Fuxuan's Moments.

07:47.680 --> 07:48.920
In the first few months,

07:48.920 --> 07:50.920
there were many likes and comments.

07:51.180 --> 07:53.110
Later, there were fewer and fewer.

07:54.420 --> 07:55.420
Everyone is busy.

07:56.570 --> 07:58.570
I was busy with my doctoral courses,

07:58.580 --> 08:00.580
and he was busy with his internship.

08:01.010 --> 08:03.310
The rainy nights
and moon of a foreign land

08:03.310 --> 08:05.040
separated us from Shen Fuxuan.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.820
Jin Baihui is still the same,

08:16.450 --> 08:17.380
never slacking.

08:18.570 --> 08:21.230
She gave up
the early admission to other schools

08:21.560 --> 08:22.810
and entered Qingbei University's

08:22.810 --> 08:25.870
Information Engineering Department
based on her college entrance exam result.

08:25.870 --> 08:28.830
Then she continued to study every day
without fail.

08:30.250 --> 08:32.080
She's in her second year
of grad school this year.

08:32.080 --> 08:35.360
It's said she's already studying
for her PhD exams.

08:36.440 --> 08:38.840
She really is the Jin Baihui
who can stir up a storm

08:38.840 --> 08:41.130
wherever she goes.

09:00.390 --> 09:02.030
Have you familiarized yourself
with the topic presentation

09:02.030 --> 09:03.390
you're giving in a few days?

09:03.390 --> 09:04.030
Yes.

09:04.200 --> 09:05.600
I can present it anytime.

09:10.390 --> 09:12.440
Electronic devices
are highly affordable nowadays.

09:12.440 --> 09:14.200
If you like this kind of digital watch,

09:14.200 --> 09:16.070
why not replace it with a smart band?

09:16.070 --> 09:18.400
It can track your sleep
and heart rate too.

09:20.030 --> 09:20.960
It's different.

09:22.240 --> 09:23.170
You have no idea.

09:23.910 --> 09:25.030
This watch

09:25.240 --> 09:27.100
used to have stars on its display.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.720
But it's been broken for 2 years.

09:29.720 --> 09:32.120
Who would wear a watch
that can't tell time?

09:33.790 --> 09:34.510
Me.

09:42.550 --> 09:44.720
When Jiang Yubai gave me this watch,

09:45.150 --> 09:45.910
he said

09:46.650 --> 09:48.770
he had an identical one.

09:52.080 --> 09:54.410
When the two watches
approach each other,

09:54.700 --> 09:56.130
shining stars

09:56.390 --> 09:57.870
appear on the watch face.

10:02.910 --> 10:05.080
Although mine no longer tells time,

10:06.080 --> 10:07.810
and the owner of the other watch

10:08.410 --> 10:10.270
already vanished into the crowd,

10:11.290 --> 10:13.510
I'm still wearing it,

10:14.200 --> 10:15.930
as if wearing a silent universe

10:16.910 --> 10:18.150
on my wrist.

10:19.870 --> 10:21.030
But, Jiang Yubai,

10:21.910 --> 10:24.040
we have been
out of contact for 5 years.

10:26.250 --> 10:27.600
Where on earth are you?

10:35.130 --> 10:38.270
[Star Shine Media]

10:46.440 --> 10:47.240
Tingting.

10:48.360 --> 10:49.870
I think if we have to
choose one out of four,

10:49.870 --> 10:51.670
we can choose Director Zhang's.

10:52.030 --> 10:53.430
It's a rare opportunity.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.550
This one too.

10:54.870 --> 10:56.000
The second male lead

10:56.630 --> 10:57.960
has a lot of screen time.

11:09.480 --> 11:11.320
What are you doing?

11:12.270 --> 11:13.440
Just looking is useless.

11:13.440 --> 11:14.440
Let's play cards.

11:15.120 --> 11:17.720
This Ace represents Director Zhang's
fame and resources.

11:16.420 --> 11:17.600
["Against the Wind"
Directed by Zhang Wendi]

11:17.720 --> 11:20.150
This second male lead role
has good screen time and exposure—

11:19.610 --> 11:21.330
["Retaliate"
Directed by Sun Yumeng]

11:20.360 --> 11:21.270
let's give it a King.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.440
This adaptation is good,

11:22.440 --> 11:24.790
but the screen time is slightly less
than the second male lead role—

11:24.610 --> 11:26.330
["One Light"
Directed by Lian Linhao]

11:24.840 --> 11:25.790
I give it a Queen.

11:26.240 --> 11:28.040
I know you don't like this drama,

11:28.320 --> 11:29.180
so let's give it a 3.

11:29.180 --> 11:32.930
["Train to Morning"
Directed by Li Cheng]

11:30.000 --> 11:32.790
Suppose our current market
is a card table.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.390
With your status and popularity,

11:34.390 --> 11:36.120
which card do you think you are?

11:36.440 --> 11:38.240
I'm developing steadily now...

11:40.550 --> 11:41.480
let's say a Five.

11:42.440 --> 11:44.320
I have a bit more experience than you,

11:44.320 --> 11:45.600
so I'll choose a 6.

11:47.600 --> 11:48.860
This rookie director,

11:49.200 --> 11:50.360
let's give him a 7.

11:50.440 --> 11:52.120
Now is the time to see our luck.

11:52.630 --> 11:54.360
Shuffle the cards and draw one.

11:55.610 --> 11:56.390
["Against the Wind"] ["Retaliate"]

11:57.510 --> 11:58.770
I shall draw this card.

12:04.790 --> 12:06.510
This Ace seems the biggest

12:06.510 --> 12:07.970
and the most domineering.

12:08.410 --> 12:11.480
["Against the Wind"] ["Retaliate"]

12:08.790 --> 12:10.000
But when a 5 like you

12:10.000 --> 12:11.390
is paired with the Ace,

12:11.670 --> 12:13.030
the Ace is the one that stands out,

12:13.030 --> 12:13.870
not you.

12:15.080 --> 12:17.150
Same goes for these two scripts.

12:15.660 --> 12:17.490
["One Light"] ["Train to Morning"]

12:17.600 --> 12:18.670
As for this 3—

12:19.030 --> 12:20.030
while it seems the smallest,

12:19.080 --> 12:23.970
["One Light"] ["Train to Morning"]

12:20.030 --> 12:21.600
it has a solid script

12:21.600 --> 12:23.750
and an imaginative rookie director.

12:24.200 --> 12:26.660
This is the card
you can really combine with.

12:29.360 --> 12:31.080
It's like your own traits,

12:31.270 --> 12:32.240
continuous effort,

12:32.240 --> 12:35.240
and other opportunities
you might encounter in the future—

12:35.240 --> 12:36.900
these often combine together

12:37.030 --> 12:38.960
to create greater possibilities.

12:39.840 --> 12:41.000
Its potential

12:41.600 --> 12:44.000
is often greater than this single Ace.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.660
So which one do you choose now?

12:50.910 --> 12:52.750
I understand.

12:53.840 --> 12:55.640
I don't want to play a single Ace.

12:56.030 --> 12:57.430
I want to form a straight.

12:58.150 --> 12:59.150
I choose this 3.

13:00.870 --> 13:02.030
After joining the crew,

13:02.030 --> 13:03.440
work harder.

13:03.440 --> 13:04.080
It will be fine.

13:04.080 --> 13:05.080
Don't worry.

13:05.510 --> 13:07.110
When have I ever let you down?

13:17.870 --> 13:18.790
Zhixia.

13:19.670 --> 13:21.270
I have something to tell you.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.630
What's wrong, Shuwen?

13:25.630 --> 13:28.440
Zhixia, can I ask you a favor?

13:28.480 --> 13:29.200
What is it?

13:31.510 --> 13:33.910
You know I've deferred my graduation
for 2 years.

13:33.910 --> 13:35.270
If I defer it again this year,

13:35.270 --> 13:37.080
I won't be able to get my master's degree.

13:37.080 --> 13:37.870
I heard

13:37.870 --> 13:40.800
Tan Qianche's research group
will definitely pass.

13:41.000 --> 13:43.000
I really need this project.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.910
Can you vote for me later?

13:47.550 --> 13:49.280
You're not the only candidate.

13:49.360 --> 13:50.550
Xu Nuo has been following this—

13:50.550 --> 13:51.360
I know.

13:51.600 --> 13:54.440
But there's only one spot left
in the research group.

13:54.440 --> 13:56.200
If I can't get into this group,

13:56.440 --> 13:58.360
I'll definitely be doomed again this year.

13:58.360 --> 14:01.360
Zhixia, please do me this favor.

14:03.120 --> 14:04.580
Not being able to graduate

14:04.750 --> 14:06.550
is a dead end.

14:06.910 --> 14:07.670
In society,

14:07.670 --> 14:09.480
it's basically murder.

14:10.780 --> 14:13.000
I'm begging you.

14:13.390 --> 14:14.390
Please.

14:15.750 --> 14:17.080
In the upcoming review,

14:17.310 --> 14:19.790
the key is not
who needs this position more,

14:20.270 --> 14:22.120
but who can better represent our group's

14:22.120 --> 14:23.630
future output and image.

14:23.910 --> 14:25.720
Everyone needs to weigh this carefully.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.750
We must differentiate the big picture

14:27.750 --> 14:29.150
from personal feelings.

14:29.750 --> 14:31.910
Especially Ms. Lin.

14:32.750 --> 14:34.910
Your opinion always carries
a lot of weight,

14:34.910 --> 14:36.440
and you see things clearly.

14:36.510 --> 14:37.480
Your vote

14:37.550 --> 14:39.240
determines the project's academic purity

14:39.240 --> 14:40.370
and how far it can go.

14:41.080 --> 14:41.910
I believe

14:42.200 --> 14:44.080
you will certainly make
the most objective choice

14:44.080 --> 14:47.000
that is most in line with the long-term
interests of the research group.

14:47.000 --> 14:47.750
Right?

14:55.750 --> 14:56.550
Zhixia.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.870
I'll see to it.

14:58.510 --> 14:59.440
Thank you.

14:59.910 --> 15:00.720
Thanks.

15:01.510 --> 15:02.720
I'll make it up to you.

15:08.110 --> 15:10.300
Qianche's research group
is still short of one person.

15:10.300 --> 15:12.870
[Tan Qianche Research Group Candidate
Voting Meeting]

15:10.550 --> 15:12.030
As usual, we will

15:12.030 --> 15:13.670
select one from the graduate students

15:13.670 --> 15:14.730
in the department.

15:17.000 --> 15:17.790
Zhixia,

15:18.750 --> 15:20.240
Zheng, Qin,

15:20.870 --> 15:22.000
Hou, and Xiong.

15:22.000 --> 15:25.440
The five of you have
no conflict of interest with this project.

15:25.440 --> 15:26.360
You will vote.

15:26.310 --> 15:30.170
[Tan Qianche Research Group Candidate
Voting Meeting]

15:27.390 --> 15:30.240
The candidates are Yang Shuwen and Xu Nuo.

15:30.670 --> 15:31.390
You are all friends,

15:31.390 --> 15:32.600
don't be constrained.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.060
Vote for whoever you want.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.360
Let's begin.

15:43.840 --> 15:45.370
Then... Then I'll go first.

15:45.790 --> 15:46.600
I vote

15:47.550 --> 15:48.480
for Yang Shuwen.

15:51.150 --> 15:52.240
I vote for Xu Nuo.

16:02.960 --> 16:03.910
I vote for Xu Nuo.

16:06.320 --> 16:07.580
I vote for Yang Shuwen.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.360
It's a two-to-two tie.

16:16.320 --> 16:18.650
It seems everyone has thought it through.

16:19.390 --> 16:20.870
This most crucial vote,

16:21.510 --> 16:22.320
Zhixia,

16:23.270 --> 16:24.150
is up to you.

16:39.630 --> 16:40.560
I vote for Xu Nuo.

16:52.100 --> 16:53.200
Let me introduce.

16:53.890 --> 16:54.700
These two

16:54.700 --> 16:56.500
are Jin Baihui's parents,

16:56.500 --> 16:58.130
Jin Quan and Zhang Li.

16:58.580 --> 17:00.130
We are old friends.

17:00.130 --> 17:00.770
Yes.

17:01.130 --> 17:03.010
This is Li Zhe's mother.

17:03.370 --> 17:04.250
Her husband

17:04.250 --> 17:06.050
is the president
of the Huacheng Chamber of Commerce.

17:06.050 --> 17:07.500
She's here today to...

17:09.420 --> 17:10.609
Let me say it.

17:11.290 --> 17:12.500
My son, Li Zhe,

17:12.609 --> 17:15.140
is a classmate
of your daughter, Jin Baihui.

17:15.660 --> 17:17.980
Jin Baihui is studying
Information Engineering,

17:17.980 --> 17:19.910
and Li Zhe is studying philosophy.

17:20.900 --> 17:22.010
Philosophy.

17:23.609 --> 17:25.740
Baihui is really excellent.

17:26.089 --> 17:28.490
My son has seen her
at school several times.

17:28.500 --> 17:30.330
He always tells me when he gets home

17:30.330 --> 17:31.500
about how he has never

17:31.500 --> 17:34.250
seen a girl
with such clear logical thinking,

17:34.420 --> 17:35.880
such a clean temperament,

17:36.570 --> 17:38.050
and so beautiful.

17:41.050 --> 17:42.250
Young people,

17:42.740 --> 17:45.090
they just want to make friends.

17:49.180 --> 17:50.500
Our Baihui

17:50.570 --> 17:52.770
just loves to read and study.

17:53.010 --> 17:54.460
She's not as good as you say.

17:54.460 --> 17:55.770
You really flatter her.

17:55.770 --> 17:56.500
Yes.

17:56.700 --> 17:59.090
It's because you two raised her well.

17:59.530 --> 18:00.570
Mrs. Li,

18:00.810 --> 18:03.380
the Jins are from a scholarly family.

18:03.420 --> 18:05.500
They've been strict
with Baihui since she was little.

18:05.500 --> 18:07.290
I've seen it all.

18:07.290 --> 18:07.900
Yes.

18:07.900 --> 18:10.700
Then Li Zhe must be very excellent too.

18:10.770 --> 18:12.180
When we see Baihui,

18:12.180 --> 18:13.900
we will definitely
have a good talk with her.

18:13.900 --> 18:14.660
Yes.

18:14.660 --> 18:15.740
Exactly.

18:15.940 --> 18:17.010
I came today

18:17.180 --> 18:18.740
just for this.

18:19.810 --> 18:20.610
I've also spoken

18:20.610 --> 18:22.330
to my husband about this.

18:22.570 --> 18:23.660
He said

18:23.810 --> 18:26.330
young people should learn from each other

18:26.330 --> 18:27.930
and make progress together.

18:28.010 --> 18:29.460
As parents,

18:30.010 --> 18:33.210
we should try our best
to create some conditions for them.

18:36.140 --> 18:37.250
Exactly.

18:37.330 --> 18:38.850
As parents,

18:38.850 --> 18:40.570
we have to think ahead about everything

18:40.570 --> 18:42.100
and look at the big picture.

18:43.330 --> 18:45.740
How about we see if Baihui
is busy right now

18:45.740 --> 18:47.270
and make a video call to her?

18:49.660 --> 18:51.140
We won't be disturbing her study, will we?

18:51.140 --> 18:52.220
-No.
-It's okay.

18:52.220 --> 18:53.500
We always call her anyway.

18:53.500 --> 18:55.360
Girls need to be raised strictly.

18:55.850 --> 18:57.420
Right, let's call her.

18:57.530 --> 18:59.220
Show Baihui some concern.

19:07.940 --> 19:08.850
Dad, what's wrong?

19:08.850 --> 19:10.050
I'm busy running data.

19:10.050 --> 19:10.850
It's nothing.

19:10.110 --> 19:13.630
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

19:11.090 --> 19:11.940
Have you eaten?

19:11.940 --> 19:13.740
Look at you, you've lost weight recently.

19:13.740 --> 19:14.530
I've told you,

19:14.530 --> 19:16.140
to eat well and sleep well.

19:16.140 --> 19:17.740
Don't stay up late, you know?

19:18.180 --> 19:19.740
I forgot. I'll eat in a bit.

19:20.180 --> 19:21.610
Baihui, listen to your dad.

19:20.410 --> 19:22.550
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

19:21.610 --> 19:22.610
Your dad is right.

19:22.660 --> 19:24.330
Health is the capital of the revolution.

19:24.330 --> 19:25.610
You must eat your meals.

19:25.610 --> 19:26.500
Do you hear me?

19:26.410 --> 19:29.040
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

19:27.530 --> 19:28.530
Girls

19:28.530 --> 19:29.930
shouldn't work too hard.

19:30.740 --> 19:31.420
Okay.

19:31.980 --> 19:33.180
By the way, look.

19:34.220 --> 19:36.290
Look, who's this?

19:34.660 --> 19:36.240
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

19:36.290 --> 19:37.850
Ms. Chen. Do you remember her?

19:37.850 --> 19:40.250
Baihui, I miss you.

19:40.420 --> 19:41.500
This lady over here

19:41.530 --> 19:43.900
is your classmate Li Zhe's mother.

19:43.900 --> 19:44.770
Say hello.

19:44.770 --> 19:45.610
Hello.

19:46.770 --> 19:47.810
Hi, Ms. Li.

19:48.420 --> 19:50.330
Sorry, I've been busy
with school recently,

19:50.330 --> 19:52.180
and I haven't had time to visit you.

19:52.180 --> 19:52.940
I apologize.

19:53.220 --> 19:54.610
It's okay, it's okay.

19:54.850 --> 19:56.530
Okay, I know you're busy.

19:56.530 --> 19:57.590
I know you're busy.

19:58.090 --> 19:59.500
I won't disturb your studies.

19:59.500 --> 20:01.570
It's fine, just call us more often.

19:59.530 --> 20:03.090
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

20:01.900 --> 20:03.190
Make sure you eat your meals.

20:03.190 --> 20:04.050
We're hanging up now.

20:04.050 --> 20:05.010
Okay, bye-bye.

20:19.660 --> 20:20.460
Zhixia.

20:21.770 --> 20:23.660
Don't you think the vote just now
was too coincidental?

20:23.660 --> 20:29.990
[Qingbei University]
[Quantum Bits and Computing]

20:26.810 --> 20:29.380
Statistically,
low-probability events do happen.

20:29.380 --> 20:31.850
No, they deliberately made it a tie

20:31.850 --> 20:33.380
to force you to take a stand.

20:36.330 --> 20:37.090
I know.

20:38.410 --> 20:46.620
[Qingbei University]
[Quantum Bits and Computing]

20:40.290 --> 20:41.980
The way they voted just now,

20:42.330 --> 20:44.260
looked like they had rehearsed it.

20:45.180 --> 20:47.570
It must have been
Tan Qianche's instruction.

20:47.570 --> 20:49.830
Then why didn't you vote for Yang Shuwen?

20:51.220 --> 20:54.330
I didn't vote for Xu Nuo
just to break the tie,

20:55.250 --> 20:58.180
but because she is really suitable
for this project.

20:58.700 --> 21:00.700
I've helped revise
everyone's master's thesis

21:00.700 --> 21:01.940
in our department.

21:02.940 --> 21:05.250
I know Shuwen
needs this project to graduate,

21:05.250 --> 21:07.570
and I know Tan Qianche
is forcing me to take a stand.

21:07.570 --> 21:09.900
No matter who I vote for,
they will hate me.

21:10.220 --> 21:11.250
I just think

21:12.610 --> 21:14.090
scientific research is not about politics

21:14.090 --> 21:15.140
or favors.

21:16.210 --> 21:17.770
Academics cannot lie.

21:22.770 --> 21:25.300
Ms. Lin Zhixia,
I have something to say to you.

21:30.530 --> 21:31.420
Do you know

21:31.420 --> 21:33.010
that your vote was the deciding one?

21:33.010 --> 21:33.900
Because of you,

21:33.900 --> 21:36.030
I might really not graduate this year.

21:36.090 --> 21:36.900
Lin Zhixia,

21:37.050 --> 21:38.740
why are you doing this to me?

21:39.090 --> 21:41.330
Shuwen, you should know very well

21:41.610 --> 21:42.850
that your research direction

21:42.850 --> 21:45.180
does not align with Tan Qianche's project.

21:45.180 --> 21:46.500
Even if you do join,

21:46.740 --> 21:49.140
this project won't give you any advantage.

21:49.180 --> 21:50.940
You will just be a marginal figure.

21:50.940 --> 21:52.010
I don't care.

21:52.050 --> 21:54.310
As long as you vote for me,
I can graduate.

21:54.570 --> 21:55.570
What about Xu Nuo?

21:55.940 --> 21:57.740
She's also in her second year
of her master's program.

21:57.740 --> 21:58.810
For the past 2 years,

21:58.810 --> 22:00.850
she has spent all her time
on this research topic.

22:00.850 --> 22:02.660
She worked uncredited for 2 years.

22:02.660 --> 22:04.390
Shouldn't she be in this group?

22:04.460 --> 22:06.120
Now you are reasoning with me.

22:06.290 --> 22:08.240
Aren't there people
in the research group too?

22:08.240 --> 22:10.170
People should consider feelings.

22:10.330 --> 22:11.610
I help you, you help me.

22:11.630 --> 22:13.360
What has Xu Nuo helped you with?

22:13.740 --> 22:14.900
Last year, for your thesis,

22:14.900 --> 22:16.940
I did my best to help you run the data.

22:17.010 --> 22:18.660
Why can't you help me?

22:18.700 --> 22:19.850
It's exactly because you helped me,

22:19.850 --> 22:21.180
I couldn't vote for you.

22:21.740 --> 22:23.660
The sub-project Tan Qianche gave you

22:23.660 --> 22:25.320
is just scraps from his paper.

22:25.460 --> 22:26.740
While Xu Nuo's model

22:26.850 --> 22:29.710
is the real direction
that can aim for top journals.

22:30.180 --> 22:31.180
If I voted for you,

22:31.570 --> 22:33.830
it would be pushing you
into a pit of fire.

22:34.050 --> 22:35.090
You can graduate,

22:35.330 --> 22:36.700
but as long as you stay in this industry,

22:36.700 --> 22:37.700
you'll find that

22:37.980 --> 22:40.180
except for the empty title
of Tan Qianche's research group,

22:40.180 --> 22:41.180
you have nothing.

22:42.300 --> 22:44.610
Shuwen, I should help you,

22:45.290 --> 22:46.420
but not by giving you a ticket

22:46.420 --> 22:48.010
to a dead end.

22:48.700 --> 22:50.900
Instead, while there's still time,
I should tell you

22:50.900 --> 22:52.300
to take a different path.

22:52.660 --> 22:53.530
A different path?

22:53.530 --> 22:54.740
What path?

22:55.010 --> 22:56.500
If I can't join this group,
I can't graduate.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.660
Do I have any other path I can take?

22:57.660 --> 22:59.700
I'll figure something out. I promise.

22:59.700 --> 23:01.700
You... stop saying these useless things.

23:01.700 --> 23:03.220
Meeting a heartless person like you

23:03.220 --> 23:05.080
who bites the hand that feeds you,

23:05.090 --> 23:06.420
I count myself unlucky.

23:13.250 --> 23:15.160
Growing up is just so frustrating.

23:14.920 --> 23:18.180
[Find what's new around you]
[Jiang Yubai]

23:18.230 --> 23:19.680
[Jiang Yubai appears in the alumni directory
of Nanhai No. 1 High School]

23:21.550 --> 23:24.440
"Lin Lin Lin Lin Lin Zhixia."

23:25.330 --> 23:27.350
I announce that from now on,

23:27.350 --> 23:28.510
you are my friend,

23:28.590 --> 23:29.750
my best friend.

23:30.140 --> 23:32.340
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai"?

23:34.050 --> 23:35.480
Actually, I've been wanting to ask you.

23:35.480 --> 23:37.210
Why did you come back this time?

23:37.330 --> 23:38.030
For you.

23:40.350 --> 23:42.030
This beam of light took 8.6 years

23:42.030 --> 23:43.160
to reach Earth.

23:44.220 --> 23:45.880
That means before we even met,

23:46.350 --> 23:47.590
it had already embarked

23:47.590 --> 23:49.010
on the journey to meet us.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.760
Duan Qiyan and the others
are my good friends,

23:51.760 --> 23:54.220
but you're more like
my binary star partner.

23:55.070 --> 23:58.030
We will advance along different orbits,

23:59.600 --> 24:02.440
but our center will always be the same.

24:11.290 --> 24:15.210
[Jiang Yubai, are you there?]

24:18.850 --> 24:19.580
Jiang Yubai.

24:20.510 --> 24:21.900
Where exactly are you?

24:30.590 --> 24:32.120
Hurry, the defibrillator!

24:34.680 --> 24:35.250
Hurry!

24:35.420 --> 24:36.050
Mom!

25:44.820 --> 25:51.170
[Repayment plan for the next 7 months:
437,000]

26:02.140 --> 26:05.340
[Qingbei University]

26:02.770 --> 26:03.550
Have you heard?

26:03.550 --> 26:04.810
Dr. Lin from our university

26:04.810 --> 26:06.410
will give us a sharing today.

26:06.530 --> 26:07.180
Really?

26:07.480 --> 26:10.880
I heard she entered our university
through early admission.

26:12.770 --> 26:13.660
Here she comes.

26:18.690 --> 26:20.000
[Qingbei University]

26:19.160 --> 26:20.740
Ms. Lin is so pretty.

26:20.900 --> 26:21.920
She really is.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.750
She's not only an overachieving scholar,

26:23.750 --> 26:25.150
but also a gorgeous lady.

26:26.630 --> 26:27.030
[Qingbei University]

26:27.060 --> 26:28.710
[Quantum Bits and Computers]

26:29.000 --> 26:32.130
Today I'll be talking about
quantum bits and computers.

26:32.350 --> 26:35.310
A classical computer bit is like a switch—

26:35.350 --> 26:36.480
it's either 0 or 1.

26:37.090 --> 26:38.140
But a quantum bit,

26:38.140 --> 26:39.030
is more like

26:39.030 --> 26:41.390
a spinning top rotating
in two opposite directions simultaneously.

26:41.390 --> 26:44.030
[The superposition state of a quantum bit]

26:41.740 --> 26:42.870
Mathematics proved

26:43.380 --> 26:45.220
that using vectors in a Hilbert space

26:44.050 --> 26:46.530
[The "perfect description" in math]

26:45.220 --> 26:48.750
can perfectly represent
this state of simultaneous rotation.

27:08.850 --> 27:10.260
[Quantum Bits and Computers]

27:11.380 --> 27:12.980
On this ordinary afternoon,

27:13.580 --> 27:15.840
the stars surprisingly showed up again.

27:17.160 --> 27:19.090
The slight heat from the dial plate

27:19.220 --> 27:23.050
is the temperature deep in my memory
that never cooled down.

27:27.000 --> 27:29.200
You told me that you wouldn't be far away

27:29.820 --> 27:31.820
as long as the stars were sparkling.

27:32.830 --> 27:33.560
Jiang Yubai,

27:34.480 --> 27:36.610
have you always been around?

27:37.050 --> 27:39.440
Did you never leave me?

27:48.770 --> 27:49.570
Master Jiang.

27:50.380 --> 27:52.330
The telescope you left on the mountain,

27:52.330 --> 27:53.930
can it really capture stars?

27:57.770 --> 27:58.700
You're amazing.

27:59.140 --> 28:00.050
You can fix appliances

28:00.050 --> 28:01.090
and do crafts.

28:02.610 --> 28:04.140
You can even capture stars.

28:04.530 --> 28:05.860
You really are a master.

28:13.570 --> 28:15.220
Go back once you get the stuff.

28:15.220 --> 28:16.480
I have something to do.

28:27.090 --> 28:28.350
Master Jiang, then...

28:28.500 --> 28:29.430
I'll be leaving.

28:36.740 --> 28:39.200
Top student,
it's time to pay the money back.

28:46.590 --> 28:48.550
Wow, you can even do this.

28:49.290 --> 28:50.180
Amazing.

28:59.090 --> 28:59.850
Six.

29:00.570 --> 29:01.700
Okay, just right.

29:02.220 --> 29:02.980
I'm leaving.

29:16.340 --> 29:20.480
[Repayment plan for the next 7 months:
437,000]

29:26.050 --> 29:29.430
[Repayment plan for the next 7 months:
437,000]

29:48.350 --> 29:53.350
[Meet Lin Zhixia]

30:47.380 --> 30:51.150
♪ With every breath, the shadows creep ♪

30:54.350 --> 30:57.550
♪ A demon in disguise ♪

30:58.870 --> 31:01.950
♪ Talking the sweetest lies ♪

31:05.840 --> 31:09.580
♪ It tries to drown me in my sleep ♪

31:10.290 --> 31:12.330
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai."

31:12.050 --> 31:15.670
♪ Pain comes like a tide ♪

31:14.810 --> 31:16.880
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai."

31:16.730 --> 31:21.330
♪ It hurts,
but I'm way too tired to hide ♪

31:21.980 --> 31:26.980
♪ Will you please hold me, help me
walk out of this endless night ♪

31:27.250 --> 31:28.900
♪ I've lost my light and power ♪

31:28.980 --> 31:31.540
♪ Lost my will to fight ♪

31:31.790 --> 31:34.870
♪ Will you stay by my side ♪

31:35.590 --> 31:36.400
Miss.

31:37.030 --> 31:38.670
It's not that I don't want to help you.

31:38.670 --> 31:40.640
The chip in this watch of yours

31:40.750 --> 31:42.440
is different from standard ones.

31:42.440 --> 31:44.000
Its code is encrypted.

31:44.270 --> 31:45.070
Even if it's broken,

31:45.070 --> 31:47.510
it's not something
that can be easily fixed.

31:47.510 --> 31:48.400
This firmware

31:48.720 --> 31:49.790
has been overwritten so many times

31:49.790 --> 31:51.640
that it has basically reached its limit.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.440
Unless you can find

31:52.440 --> 31:54.350
the person who flashed this firmware,

31:54.350 --> 31:55.920
otherwise, if you force it,

31:56.070 --> 31:58.270
it's very likely that this watch
will be completely ruined.

31:58.270 --> 31:59.600
That would be a problem.

32:00.550 --> 32:02.680
Please see if there are any other ways.

32:03.200 --> 32:05.130
This watch is very important to me.

32:05.350 --> 32:06.400
I can pay extra.

32:06.400 --> 32:07.460
As much as you want.

32:07.590 --> 32:08.990
It's not about the money.

32:09.640 --> 32:10.840
Let me put it this way—

32:11.110 --> 32:12.680
this code encryption

32:12.680 --> 32:14.750
is like the person who made this watch

32:14.750 --> 32:16.400
put a combination lock on it.

32:16.550 --> 32:17.590
The rest of us

32:17.590 --> 32:19.400
can try to crack the code.

32:19.590 --> 32:21.830
If we're lucky,
we might open it on the first try.

32:21.830 --> 32:23.750
But if we try a few times
and get it wrong,

32:23.750 --> 32:25.200
the lock will protect itself

32:25.200 --> 32:26.160
and lock itself down.

32:26.160 --> 32:28.020
Then no one will be able to open it.

32:28.110 --> 32:31.030
So this is very risky.

32:31.030 --> 32:33.030
I really don't dare to take this job.

32:33.160 --> 32:34.000
I'm sorry.

32:38.070 --> 32:39.440
Sorry to bother you then.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.040
It's okay.

32:52.750 --> 32:53.590
Hey, Miss.

32:55.270 --> 32:56.440
Miss.

32:56.550 --> 32:57.480
My name's Cheng.

32:58.510 --> 32:59.510
Can I help you?

33:00.350 --> 33:02.640
I might have a way to fix that watch.

33:04.160 --> 33:05.160
I know a master.

33:05.720 --> 33:07.240
His skills are very advanced.

33:07.240 --> 33:09.160
He specializes in fixing weird things.

33:09.160 --> 33:12.420
Things that can't be fixed
in these places can't stump him.

33:15.480 --> 33:16.340
How about this?

33:17.070 --> 33:17.880
If it's okay,

33:18.270 --> 33:19.400
let's add each other on WeChat.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.200
I'll take the watch

33:20.200 --> 33:21.600
and show it to our master.

33:21.790 --> 33:24.590
If he can't fix it,
I promise to return it exactly as it is.

33:24.590 --> 33:25.990
You have nothing to lose.

33:27.070 --> 33:28.680
But I've asked many places.

33:29.790 --> 33:31.200
This kind of self-encrypted code,

33:31.200 --> 33:32.600
if it can't be decrypted,

33:32.750 --> 33:34.070
it's very likely to be damaged.

33:34.070 --> 33:34.880
I know.

33:34.920 --> 33:37.320
Our master also does computer decryption.

33:38.880 --> 33:39.960
He's really amazing.

33:39.960 --> 33:41.960
Your watch isn't that complicated.

33:42.000 --> 33:43.830
Last time he even fixed

33:44.500 --> 33:48.000
a brainwave controller
modified from a handheld game console.

33:48.000 --> 33:49.240
I'll take it back for him to see.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.110
If he can't fix it,

33:50.110 --> 33:50.960
it's free.

33:51.590 --> 33:54.830
-But if it's fixed...
-I'll pay whatever it takes.

33:55.030 --> 33:57.830
All right, come on,
let's add each other on WeChat.

33:59.790 --> 34:01.790
Brother Jiang, this is a big job.

34:02.110 --> 34:04.440
A programmed electronic watch is broken.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.590
I took a quick look.

34:05.790 --> 34:07.790
The encryption algorithm
inside is very complicated.

34:07.790 --> 34:08.989
I can't figure it out.

34:09.110 --> 34:10.170
Can you take a look?

34:12.000 --> 34:13.920
I need to speed up paying off my debts.

34:13.920 --> 34:15.580
I'm not available this month.

34:17.320 --> 34:18.800
The client said

34:19.000 --> 34:20.190
as long as it can be fixed,

34:20.190 --> 34:21.449
they'll pay any price.

34:23.800 --> 34:24.800
This watch seemed

34:25.480 --> 34:27.080
very important to that lady.

34:27.800 --> 34:28.960
If you can fix it,

34:29.110 --> 34:30.360
we'll make a fortune.

34:34.360 --> 34:35.550
Just take a look.

34:35.590 --> 34:36.840
It's easy money.

34:48.400 --> 34:49.800
Where did this come from?

34:50.800 --> 34:51.800
What do you mean?

34:52.230 --> 34:53.960
Where did this watch come from?

34:54.150 --> 34:55.550
F-From the watch shop.

34:57.440 --> 35:00.000
When I was looking for work,
a lady was asking around

35:00.000 --> 35:01.600
if this watch could be fixed.

35:01.760 --> 35:02.560
What's wrong?

35:08.510 --> 35:10.590
Master Jiang, what's wrong?

35:20.110 --> 35:20.960
I can't fix it.

35:21.630 --> 35:22.320
Hey...

35:22.440 --> 35:23.150
You...

35:23.190 --> 35:25.250
You haven't even taken a closer look.

35:28.550 --> 35:29.280
Jiang?

35:30.440 --> 35:31.240
Master Jiang?

35:35.360 --> 35:36.000
All right.

35:36.190 --> 35:37.450
I'll reply to her then.

35:45.110 --> 35:47.030
Miss Lin, I'm sorry.

35:47.230 --> 35:48.560
I showed it to my master.

35:49.480 --> 35:51.110
He said it can't be fixed.

35:51.480 --> 35:53.680
How about I send it back to you tomorrow?

36:05.920 --> 36:06.920
Thank you anyway.

36:07.510 --> 36:08.800
I'll ask someone else.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.800
Jiang, I'm leaving.

36:23.710 --> 36:24.510
Wait a minute.

36:29.230 --> 36:29.960
The watch...

36:31.590 --> 36:32.400
leave it here.

36:34.760 --> 36:36.960
Didn't you just say you couldn't fix it?

36:38.590 --> 36:39.650
Just leave it here.

36:40.030 --> 36:41.360
I'll take another look.

36:42.360 --> 36:43.890
I might not be able to fix it.

36:44.190 --> 36:45.800
Don't tell her yet.

36:47.800 --> 36:48.400
Okay.

36:48.860 --> 36:50.360
Then I'll get going.

37:06.730 --> 37:13.450
[Cheng]

37:55.230 --> 37:56.290
You're still here,

37:57.730 --> 37:58.360
right?

38:03.900 --> 38:05.260
But where are you now?

38:08.690 --> 38:09.500
I kind of...

38:11.170 --> 38:12.190
miss you.

38:49.400 --> 38:50.510
It's really fixed.

38:50.960 --> 38:53.090
I told you our Master Jiang is amazing.

38:53.110 --> 38:54.240
He can fix anything.

38:54.590 --> 38:56.320
He's just been too busy lately,

38:56.800 --> 38:57.880
so he didn't agree at first.

38:57.880 --> 38:59.080
What did you call him?

39:00.590 --> 39:01.840
M-Master Jiang.

39:02.400 --> 39:04.060
My master's surname is Jiang.

39:04.110 --> 39:06.040
They say he used to be a top student.

39:06.590 --> 39:08.840
By the way, I sent the bill to your phone.

39:09.110 --> 39:10.590
Miss, please pay the bill.

39:32.360 --> 39:33.070
We're here.

39:33.320 --> 39:34.710
This used to be my family's garage.

39:34.710 --> 39:36.110
We rented it to him later.

39:48.440 --> 39:49.110
Jiang!

39:49.920 --> 39:50.710
Jiang?

39:51.630 --> 39:53.030
The client who had her watch fixed
last time

39:53.030 --> 39:54.960
insists on thanking you in person.

40:10.280 --> 40:11.140
Brother Jiang.

40:31.760 --> 40:32.620
Brother Jiang.

40:35.310 --> 40:42.170
[Watch out for the train]

40:40.320 --> 40:42.110
That's weird. He was just here.

40:43.760 --> 40:44.590
How strange.

40:45.070 --> 40:46.330
Where did he run off to?

40:46.510 --> 40:47.510
Where could he be?

40:52.060 --> 40:54.680
[Watch out for the train]

40:55.240 --> 40:59.890
[Bai]

40:56.840 --> 40:58.300
Find a way to send her away.

40:58.460 --> 40:59.660
Just say I'm not here.

40:59.860 --> 41:00.810
Damn.

41:00.840 --> 41:01.590
What?

41:02.400 --> 41:03.990
[Watch out for the train]

41:02.800 --> 41:04.110
Nothing. It's not him.

41:07.710 --> 41:08.440
I just remembered.

41:08.440 --> 41:09.920
We have an external job today.

41:09.920 --> 41:11.180
He might have gone out.

41:12.150 --> 41:14.710
But I just heard a noise inside.

41:15.230 --> 41:16.560
You must have misheard.

41:16.760 --> 41:17.550
This crappy warehouse

41:17.550 --> 41:19.610
makes noise whenever the wind blows.

41:19.670 --> 41:20.480
Master Jiang

41:21.840 --> 41:22.710
probably went out.

41:22.710 --> 41:24.150
He won't be back for a while.

41:24.150 --> 41:26.840
Miss Lin, why don't you go back first?

41:26.840 --> 41:27.510
No need.

41:28.510 --> 41:30.000
He'll come back, right?

41:30.320 --> 41:31.630
I'll wait for him right here.

41:31.630 --> 41:33.030
I have nothing going on today anyway.

41:33.030 --> 41:33.920
Well...

41:34.150 --> 41:35.230
With his temper,

41:35.320 --> 41:36.360
you'll be waiting for nothing.

41:36.360 --> 41:37.150
It's fine.

41:38.000 --> 41:39.660
I'll wait until he comes back.

41:39.760 --> 41:40.480
You...

41:47.490 --> 41:49.210
[Bai]

41:48.090 --> 41:48.890
Just leave it.

41:49.920 --> 41:50.710
Miss Lin,

41:51.480 --> 41:53.030
he won't be back for a while.

41:53.880 --> 41:54.940
Why don't you wait,

41:55.440 --> 41:56.960
and I'll leave first?

41:58.920 --> 41:59.710
Thank you.

42:09.280 --> 42:11.010
As I stood in front of this door,

42:13.280 --> 42:15.740
I didn't know
if it was Jiang Yubai behind it.

42:17.550 --> 42:20.010
Nor did I know
if Jiang Yubai wanted to see me.

42:21.650 --> 42:22.570
Perhaps,

42:24.150 --> 42:26.400
what separates us is not just time,

42:27.530 --> 42:29.390
but completely different paths,

42:30.150 --> 42:31.900
and unspeakable realities.

42:33.360 --> 42:33.960
I realized

43:25.020 --> 43:30.610
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

43:32.150 --> 43:37.910
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

43:39.060 --> 44:48.650
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

43:46.010 --> 43:51.850
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

43:54.220 --> 44:00.500
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

44:01.310 --> 44:06.770
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

44:07.610 --> 44:10.500
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

44:11.170 --> 44:14.060
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

44:14.530 --> 44:16.810
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

44:17.160 --> 44:20.850
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

44:21.630 --> 44:24.100
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

44:24.810 --> 44:27.630
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

44:28.300 --> 44:30.900
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

44:31.650 --> 44:34.990
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

44:35.710 --> 44:38.880
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

44:39.300 --> 44:42.160
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

44:42.640 --> 44:48.650
♪ Hence I lose you, time and again ♪

44:49.630 --> 44:52.390
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

44:53.100 --> 44:56.020
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

44:56.550 --> 44:58.830
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

44:59.170 --> 45:02.790
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

45:03.630 --> 45:06.010
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

45:06.820 --> 45:09.640
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

45:10.310 --> 45:12.910
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

45:13.660 --> 45:17.000
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

45:17.720 --> 45:20.840
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

45:21.310 --> 45:24.060
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

45:24.650 --> 45:30.550
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

45:30.320 --> 45:33.190
I want to be with you forever.

45:31.190 --> 45:35.240
♪ Myself ♪

45:35.190 --> 45:37.190
You will always be my one and only...

45:38.000 --> 45:38.960
best friend.

46:02.710 --> 46:05.590
♪ Let the wind pass you ♪

46:06.380 --> 46:09.170
♪ I'll never respond again ♪

46:09.570 --> 46:11.820
♪ I thought I could ♪

46:12.760 --> 46:16.200
♪ Forget ♪

46:14.360 --> 46:17.500
"Lin Lin Lin Lin Lin Zhixia."

46:50.750 --> 46:54.660
♪ With every breath, the shadows creep ♪

46:57.730 --> 47:01.040
♪ A demon in disguise ♪

47:02.350 --> 47:05.430
♪ Talking the sweetest lies ♪

47:09.290 --> 47:12.990
♪ It tries to drown me in my sleep ♪

47:15.540 --> 47:19.000
♪ Pain comes like a tide ♪

47:20.260 --> 47:24.860
♪ It hurts,
but I'm way too tired to hide ♪

47:25.510 --> 47:30.480
♪ Will you please hold me, help me
walk out of this endless night ♪

47:30.720 --> 47:32.120
♪ I've lost my light and power ♪

47:32.390 --> 47:34.920
♪ Lost my will to fight ♪

47:35.270 --> 47:38.440
♪ Will you stay by my side ♪

47:39.720 --> 47:42.640
♪ Be my light tonight ♪

47:43.930 --> 47:53.110
♪ Let's run away ♪

47:53.770 --> 47:56.420
♪ Embrace the light ♪

47:57.450 --> 48:01.250
♪ With you, I'll win this fight ♪

48:02.070 --> 48:11.510
♪ Let's run away ♪

48:12.100 --> 48:14.670
♪ No time to cry ♪

48:15.500 --> 48:19.430
♪ Your love will guide us
through the night ♪

